# Run notes — exp-dogfood-1-muse-toy-quest c4 (muse)

## What was built

- `flappy.html` in this run folder: the three.js Flappy Bird demo (same `flappy` spelling as c1–c3), so the artifact plus traces live in this exp's `runs/` as the exp asks. Module script extracted and verified with `node --check` (pass).

## Lessons

- The author child's edge is `submit` (`todo -> submitted`); `full drive` to landed/`exp_fin` is owned by grade and land steps, so this run does not claim it.
